# Dragon Magazine Compendium - features of the substitution levels (subst_build.py).


###Block: Elf Paladin substitution levels
Elf Paladin	KEY:Elf Paladin ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.422	DESC:Though elves tend toward chaos, an elf paladin can become a beacon of righteousness, trading some single-minded dedication for abilities suited to his racial aptitudes. Requirements: an elf about to take his 1st, 3rd or 5th paladin level. Class skills: the paladin's plus Survival.
Ranged Smite Evil	KEY:Elf Paladin ~ Ranged Smite Evil	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	ABILITY:Paladin Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Paladin ~ Smite Evil	SOURCEPAGE:p.422	DESC:The elf paladin can deliver his smite evil attacks only with a longbow, shortbow or their composite versions, against a target within 30 feet; otherwise identical to smite evil (same daily uses). Replaces smite evil.
Aura of Freedom	KEY:Elf Paladin ~ Aura of Freedom	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.422	DESC:Each ally within 10 feet gains a +4 morale bonus on saving throws against enchantment effects, while the paladin is conscious. Replaces aura of courage.
Unicorn Mount	KEY:Elf Paladin ~ Unicorn Mount	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Special Mount	BONUS:VAR|SpecialMountLVL|PaladinLVL	COMPANIONLIST:Special Mount|Unicorn	SOURCEPAGE:p.422	DESC:Identical to the special mount, but the mount is a unicorn, available from 5th level, and the paladin counts as six levels lower for its bonus HD, natural armor and Strength adjustment only (apply those -6 by hand; its other special abilities follow her full level); it serves regardless of the paladin's gender. Replaces the special mount (the standard mounts remain listed).

###Block: Half-Orc Paladin substitution levels
Half-Orc Paladin	KEY:Half-Orc Paladin ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.428	DESC:Rare half-orcs dedicated to law and goodness become zealous protectors of righteousness. Requirements: a half-orc about to take his 1st, 3rd or 6th paladin level. Hit Die d12 for these levels. Class skills: the paladin's except Diplomacy, plus Intimidate (Diplomacy is not removed here).
Righteous Fury	KEY:Half-Orc Paladin ~ Righteous Fury	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.428	DESC:Once per day (one more at 5th level and every five levels), as a free action, a +%1 morale bonus on melee weapon damage rolls (+2, +1 per four class levels, +7 at 20th) for 1 + Charisma bonus rounds. Replaces smite evil - the half-orc paladin never gains smite evil.|2+floor(PaladinLVL/4)
Aura of Awe	KEY:Half-Orc Paladin ~ Aura of Awe	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Immunity to Fear	SOURCEPAGE:p.428	DESC:The paladin is immune to fear; evil creatures within 10 feet take a -2 penalty on saves against fear effects (or on checks to resist his Intimidate attempts). Replaces aura of courage.
Remove Fatigue	KEY:Half-Orc Paladin ~ Remove Fatigue	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.428	DESC:Removes the fatigued condition from all allies in a 30-foot burst (not exhausted ones), %1 times per week (once at 6th level, one more every three levels). Replaces remove disease - he never gains weekly uses of remove disease.|1+floor((PaladinLVL-6)/3)

###Block: Harmonious Knight substitution levels
Harmonious Knight	KEY:Harmonious Knight ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.429	DESC:Paladins of Milil's Harmonious Order, gifted with musical abilities. Requirements: Milil as patron deity, membership in the Harmonious Order (not checked), 1 rank in Knowledge (religion), about to take the 1st, 6th or 9th paladin level. Class skills: the paladin's plus Perform.
Inspire Courage	KEY:Harmonious Knight ~ Inspire Courage	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.429	DESC:As a standard action, war songs grant all allies that hear him a +1 morale bonus on attack and damage rolls while he sings and 5 rounds after; %1 times per day (once per paladin level). Replaces detect evil.|PaladinLVL
Inspire Competence	KEY:Harmonious Knight ~ Inspire Competence	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.429	DESC:With at least 4 ranks in Perform, once per day, an ally within 30 feet who sees and hears him gains a +2 competence bonus on checks with one skill while he sings (up to 2 minutes); mind-affecting. Replaces the remove disease gained at 6th level - from then on he has one fewer weekly use of remove disease than a normal paladin (by hand).
Inspire Greatness	KEY:Harmonious Knight ~ Inspire Greatness	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.429	DESC:With at least 5 ranks in Perform, once per day (one more for each later use of remove disease he gives up), he or one ally gains 2 bonus Hit Dice (d10) and the temporary hit points, +2 competence on attack rolls and +1 competence on Fortitude saves while he sings and 5 rounds after; mind-affecting. Replaces the second weekly use of remove disease gained at 9th level (by hand).

###Block: Paladin of Light substitution levels
Paladin of Light	KEY:Paladin of Light ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.439	DESC:Paladins drawn into the war between darkness and light, with gifts against the sun's heat. Requirements: come from a sun-centered society or worship a sun deity (not checked), about to take the 1st, 2nd or 6th paladin level.
Detect Night Creature	KEY:Paladin of Light ~ Detect Night Creature	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.439	DESC:At will, the paladin of light can detect night creatures, as the spell detect night creature. Replaces detect evil.
Cooling Touch	KEY:Paladin of Light ~ Cooling Touch	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.439	DESC:With Charisma 12 or higher, she can grant %1 points of fire resistance per day by touch (paladin level x Charisma bonus), divided as she wishes, each lasting 10 minutes per paladin level; standard action. Replaces lay on hands.|PaladinLVL*MAX(CHA,0)
Remove Curse	KEY:Paladin of Light ~ Remove Curse	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SPELLS:Innate|TIMES=1+floor((PaladinLVL-6)/3)|TIMEUNIT=Week|CASTERLEVEL=PaladinLVL|Remove Curse	SOURCEPAGE:p.439	DESC:She can produce a remove curse effect, as the spell, %1 times per week (once at 6th level, one more every three levels). Replaces remove disease.|1+floor((PaladinLVL-6)/3)

###Block: Planar Paladin substitution levels
Planar Paladin	KEY:Planar Paladin ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.440	DESC:Paladins who carry a bit of their deity's plane wherever they go. Alignment lawful good. Requirements: about to take the 4th, 6th or 10th paladin level, and any one of: 1 rank in Knowledge (the planes), a heritage feat, the extraplanar subtype on the Material Plane, or a visit to another plane. Class skills: the paladin's plus Knowledge (the planes).
Smite Evil Outsider	KEY:Planar Paladin ~ Smite Evil Outsider	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.440	DESC:Once per day per 1 + Charisma modifier (%1/day, minimum 1), one melee attack against an evil outsider adds her Charisma bonus to damage and counts as good-aligned for damage reduction (on a lawful and good plane also her Charisma bonus to the attack); stacks with smite evil on the same attack. Replaces turn undead.|max(1,1+CHA)
Celestial Mount	KEY:Planar Paladin ~ Celestial Mount	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.440	DESC:She may apply the celestial template to her special mount (darkvision 60 ft., SR HD+5 up to 25, resistance to acid, cold and electricity 5 - 10 with 8+ HD -, DR 5/magic from 4 HD or 10/magic from 12 HD, magic natural weapons, smite evil 1/day). Replaces the remove disease gained at 6th level - from then on one fewer weekly use (by hand).
Alignment Purity	KEY:Planar Paladin ~ Alignment Purity	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.440	DESC:She ignores the penalty on Intelligence-, Wisdom- and Charisma-based checks on chaotic- or evil-aligned planes; it affects only her. Replaces the third daily smite evil gained at 10th level - from then on one fewer daily use of smite evil (by hand).

###Block: Shadow Cloak Knight substitution levels
Shadow Cloak Knight	KEY:Shadow Cloak Knight ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.445	DESC:Gnome paladins of the Knights of the Shadowy Cloak, who eliminate evil humanoids in secret. Requirements: a gnome, membership in the order (not checked), 1 rank in Knowledge (religion), about to take the 4th, 6th or 9th paladin level. Class skills: the paladin's plus Hide and Move Silently.
Favored Enemy	KEY:Shadow Cloak Knight ~ Favored Enemy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.445	DESC:She gains humanoids (any one subtype listed for rangers) as a favored enemy: +2 on weapon damage rolls against them and on Bluff, Listen, Sense Motive, Spot and Survival checks against them. Replaces turn undead.
Hide in Plain Sight	KEY:Shadow Cloak Knight ~ Hide in Plain Sight	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.445	DESC:She can use Hide even with nothing to hide behind or while observed, within 10 feet of shadowy illumination or in the dark (not in her own shadow; in a creature's shadow only if it is Large or larger, never from that creature). Replaces remove disease.
One with the Darkness	KEY:Shadow Cloak Knight ~ One with the Darkness	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SPELLS:Innate|TIMES=1|CASTERLEVEL=PaladinLVL|Invisibility	SOURCEPAGE:p.445	DESC:Once per day she can become invisible, as the spell invisibility; caster level = paladin level.

###Block: Solstice Knight substitution levels
Solstice Knight	KEY:Solstice Knight ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.445	DESC:Champions who keep the long vigil of the winter solstice and find their faith rewarded at dawn. Requirements: about to take the 3rd or 5th paladin level (after enduring a solstice vigil).
Blessed Radiance	KEY:Solstice Knight ~ Blessed Radiance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SPELLS:Innate|TIMES=MIN((PaladinSmiteEvilLVL/5)+1,5)|CASTERLEVEL=PaladinLVL|Daylight	SOURCEPAGE:p.445	DESC:As a free action she casts daylight centered on herself, %1 times per day (as many as her daily uses of smite evil - the two are unrelated); caster level = paladin level. Replaces divine health.|MIN((PaladinSmiteEvilLVL/5)+1,5)
Darkvision	KEY:Solstice Knight ~ Darkvision	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	BONUS:VAR|DarkvisionRange|30	SOURCEPAGE:p.445	DESC:She gains darkvision 30 feet, or +30 feet to the range of darkvision she already has.
Strike of the Faithful	KEY:Solstice Knight ~ Strike of the Faithful	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.445	DESC:When she smites an evil undead creature, she deals double the smite damage. She loses one daily use of smite evil when she gains this ability, and has one fewer use per day thereafter (only two at 10th level; by hand).

###Block: Vigilant Eye of Helm substitution levels
Vigilant Eye of Helm	KEY:Vigilant Eye of Helm (DMC) ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.448	DESC:Paladins of Helm's growing order, known for humility and self-sacrifice, who recognize danger and protect others. Requirements: Helm as patron deity, membership in the Vigilant Eyes of the God (not checked), 1 rank in Knowledge (religion), about to take the 1st, 3rd or 4th paladin level. (Champions of Valor has these abilities but not the substitution class.)
Know Greatest Enemy	KEY:Vigilant Eye of Helm (DMC) ~ Know Greatest Enemy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.448	DESC:She automatically knows which enemy she can see within 60 feet is the most powerful (highest CR), and whether it is significantly more powerful than her (CR 4 or more above her effective character level). Replaces detect evil.
Expanded Spell List	KEY:Vigilant Eye of Helm (DMC) ~ Expanded Spell List	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SPELLLEVEL:CLASS|Paladin=2|See Invisibility	SOURCEPAGE:p.448	DESC:See invisibility is added to her paladin spell list as a 2nd-level spell.
Vigilant Aid	KEY:Vigilant Eye of Helm (DMC) ~ Vigilant Aid	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.448	DESC:Using the aid another action in melee to give an ally a bonus to AC costs her only a move action; she can aid several times per round, but no ally more than once per round this way. Replaces divine health.
Awesome Smite	KEY:Vigilant Eye of Helm (DMC) ~ Awesome Smite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.448	DESC:As a standard action she spends a daily smite evil attempt to strike an evil creature as with the Awesome Blow feat (without its prerequisites, as one size category larger), instead of the normal smite benefit; against a non-evil creature it deals normal damage and still uses the attempt. Replaces turn undead.

###Block: Warforged Paladin substitution levels
Warforged Paladin	KEY:Warforged Paladin ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.449	DESC:Rare warforged paladins following a simple faith of good will. Requirements: a warforged about to take the 1st, 2nd or 3rd paladin level. Class skills: Concentration, Craft, Knowledge (nobility and royalty), Knowledge (religion), Profession and Ride (the paladin's other class skills are not removed here).
Smite Construct	KEY:Warforged Paladin ~ Smite Construct	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.449	DESC:He can use smite evil against a construct, regardless of its alignment, with the normal bonuses.
Durable Will	KEY:Warforged Paladin ~ Durable Will	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	BONUS:SAVE|Will|MAX(CON,0)	SOURCEPAGE:p.449	DESC:He adds his Constitution bonus (if any) to Will saves. Replaces divine grace.
Repair Damage	KEY:Warforged Paladin ~ Repair Damage	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.449	DESC:With Constitution 12 or higher he can repair %1 points of damage per day (paladin level x Constitution bonus) to constructs or living constructs, himself included, by touch (standard action), or heal living creatures for half the points spent; it cannot harm undead. Replaces lay on hands.|PaladinLVL*MAX(CON,0)
Immunity to Stunning	KEY:Warforged Paladin ~ Immunity to Stunning	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Immunity to Stunning	SOURCEPAGE:p.449	DESC:From 3rd level he cannot be stunned. Replaces divine health.

###Block: Wayward Warden substitution levels
Wayward Warden	KEY:Wayward Warden ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.451	DESC:Halfling paladins defending halfling communities and caravans, using their companions' stealth. Requirements: a halfling, membership in the Wayward Wardens (not checked), 1 rank in Knowledge (religion), about to take the 3rd, 5th or 10th paladin level.
Distracting Presence	KEY:Wayward Warden ~ Distracting Presence	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.451	DESC:When confronting evil she focuses her foes' attention on herself: each takes a -4 penalty on Spot and Listen checks while she is present. Replaces aura of courage.
Use Your Allies	KEY:Wayward Warden ~ Use Your Allies	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.451	DESC:When flanking a foe at least one size category larger than herself she deals +1d6 damage on every attack, even if the foe cannot be flanked (not when it is merely denied its Dexterity bonus); otherwise as sneak attack. Replaces the second daily smite evil gained at 5th level - one fewer daily use from then on (by hand).
Commanding Presence	KEY:Wayward Warden ~ Commanding Presence	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Paladin Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.451	DESC:Once per day as a standard action, allies (not herself) within 60 feet who see and hear her gain a competence bonus of +%1 on attack rolls (her Charisma bonus, maximum +5) for 1 round per paladin level. Replaces the third daily smite evil gained at 10th level - one more fewer use (by hand).|MIN(MAX(CHA,0),5)

###Block: Azurin Cleric substitution levels
Azurin Cleric	KEY:Azurin Cleric ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Cleric Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.152	DESC:Azurin clerics channel incarnum rather than mere positive or negative energy. Requirements: an azurin about to take the 1st, 4th or 9th cleric level. Class skills: the cleric's plus Knowledge (the planes).
Aligned Spells	KEY:Azurin Cleric ~ Aligned Spells	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Cleric Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.152	DESC:She can cast only spells whose alignment descriptors match her own alignment (a chaotic good azurin cleric cannot cast evil or lawful spells). Replaces the standard cleric restriction on spell alignments.
Channel Incarnum	KEY:Azurin Cleric ~ Channel Incarnum	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Cleric Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.152	DESC:Once per round as a free action she grants herself bonus essentia equal to her Charisma bonus or half her cleric level, whichever is lower (minimum 1: %1 now), lasting 1 round; %2 times per day (3 + Charisma modifier). It counts as turn or rebuke undead for divine feats, whose daily uses it can power (a standard action unless the feat says otherwise). Replaces turn or rebuke undead.|max(1,min(CHA,floor(ClericLVL/2)))|3+CHA
Soultouched Weapon	KEY:Azurin Cleric ~ Soultouched Weapon	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Cleric Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.152	DESC:As a move action she gives a held melee weapon one alignment component of her own (not if she is neutral) for overcoming damage reduction, and may invest essentia in it for an equal insight bonus on damage against creatures with an opposed component; it lasts %1 rounds (3 + half her level), %2 times per day (3 + Charisma modifier). Replaces the 2nd-level spell slot gained at 4th level - from then on one fewer 2nd-level slot (by hand).|3+floor(ClericLVL/2)|3+CHA
Distribute Incarnum	KEY:Azurin Cleric ~ Distribute Incarnum	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Cleric Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.152	DESC:As a standard action she sacrifices a cleric spell of 5th level or higher: all allies within 30 feet (herself included) gain bonus essentia equal to its level, invested at once and lasting until the end of her next turn; those without an essentia pool heal 1 hit point per point instead (living or undead). Replaces spontaneous cure or inflict spells of 5th level and higher (by hand).

###Block: Planar Cleric substitution levels
Planar Cleric	KEY:Planar Cleric ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Cleric Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.170	DESC:Clerics who walk the planes. Requirements: about to take the 4th, 7th or 11th cleric level, and any one of: 1 rank in Knowledge (the planes), a heritage feat, the extraplanar subtype on the Material Plane, or a visit to another plane.
Planar Dismissal	KEY:Planar Cleric ~ Planar Dismissal	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Cleric Class Feature	BONUS:VAR|TurnLevelBase|-3	SOURCEPAGE:p.170	DESC:He spends a turn/rebuke attempt and makes a level check (1d20 + cleric level) against DC 11 + the summoner's caster level (or HD), +2 if the creature's alignment has a component opposed to his, to return one visible summoned extraplanar creature within 60 feet to its home plane; not one with more HD than his caster level + Charisma modifier. He turns undead as a cleric three levels lower (applied).
Planar Domain	KEY:Planar Cleric ~ Planar Domain	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Cleric Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.170	DESC:A non-neutral cleric may give up the two domains gained at 1st level for the planar domain matching his alignment (Abyss CE, Arborea CG, Baator LE, Celestia LG, Elysium NG, Hades NE, Limbo CN, Mechanus LN - Planar Handbook domains, not in the compendium): he loses the old granted powers, their domain-granted class skills become cross-class for later levels, and fills his domain slots from the planar domain (by hand).
Planar Banishment (Spontaneous)	KEY:Planar Cleric ~ Planar Banishment (Spontaneous)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Cleric Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.170	DESC:He can lose any prepared non-domain spell of 6th level or higher to cast banishment (save DC as heightened to the lost spell's level). Replaces spontaneous cure or inflict spells of 6th level and higher (by hand).

###Block: Raptoran Cleric substitution levels
Raptoran Cleric	KEY:Raptoran Cleric ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Cleric Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.173	DESC:Raptoran clerics bonded with air and its denizens. Requirements: a raptoran with the Air or Sky domain, about to take the 1st, 3rd or 7th cleric level.
Air Mastery	KEY:Raptoran Cleric ~ Air Mastery	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Cleric Class Feature	ABILITY:Internal|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=ArmorProfMedium|TYPE=ShieldProf|TYPE=WeaponProfSimple	SOURCEPAGE:p.173	DESC:Airborne creatures take a -1 penalty on attack and damage rolls against him. Replaces heavy armor proficiency (he keeps simple weapons, light and medium armor and shields).
Empathy of the Winds	KEY:Raptoran Cleric ~ Empathy of the Winds	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Cleric Class Feature	AUTO:LANG|Auran	SOURCEPAGE:p.173	DESC:He learns Auran as a bonus language, gains +4 on Diplomacy checks with natives of the Elemental Plane of Air, +4 on turning checks to bolster air creatures (if he can), and allied air elementals within 60 feet gain a +1 morale bonus on attack and damage rolls.
Air Summoning Talent	KEY:Raptoran Cleric ~ Air Summoning Talent	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Cleric Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.173	DESC:Air creatures are added to his summon monster lists: II Small air elemental, III air mephit, IV Medium, V Large, VI Huge, VII greater, VIII elder air elemental. All spells with the earth descriptor are removed from his cleric spell list (versions with the earth descriptor of other spells cannot be cast) - by hand.
Open the Wind-Gate	KEY:Raptoran Cleric ~ Open the Wind-Gate	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Cleric Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.173	DESC:With the planar ally spells he can call more powerful air elementals: an 8 HD Large air elemental with lesser planar ally, a 16 HD Huge (or two 8 HD Large) with planar ally, a 24 HD elder air elemental with greater planar ally.

###Block: Elf Ranger substitution levels
Elf Ranger	KEY:Elf Ranger ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.480	DESC:Elf rangers combining sylvan grace with deadly skill, with extra bonuses against their race's foes. Requirements: an elf about to take the 1st, 4th or 10th ranger level. Class skills: the ranger's plus Balance; 8 + Int skill points at these levels (by hand).
Elf Favored Enemy	KEY:Elf Ranger ~ Elf Favored Enemy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	ABILITY:Ranger Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Ranger ~ Favored Enemy	SOURCEPAGE:p.480	DESC:As the ranger's favored enemy, but against humanoid (orc), undead or "servants of Lolth" (drow, monstrous spiders, driders - a new option) the bonuses are +3, and each later bonus increase against them is +3 instead of +2 (by hand). Replaces the 1st-level favored enemy.
Elven Hound Companion	KEY:Elf Ranger ~ Elven Hound Companion	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.480	DESC:He can select an elven hound (a magical beast) as his animal companion; for his spells affecting animals, Handle Animal and wild empathy it counts as an animal.
Strongheart Slayer	KEY:Elf Ranger ~ Strongheart Slayer	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Favored Enemy|-1	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Favored Enemy Bonus|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.480	DESC:A +4 morale bonus on Will saves against the spells and spell-like abilities of drow and driders, and on Fortitude saves against the poison of monstrous spiders. Replaces the third favored enemy and its extra bonus gained at 10th level (applied); he gains his third favored enemy at 15th instead.

###Block: Fangshields Ranger substitution levels
Fangshields Ranger	KEY:Fangshields Ranger ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.481	DESC:Nonhumanoid rangers of the Fangshields who patrol the wildlands and lead beasts. Requirements: a nonhumanoid creature, member of the Fangshields (not checked), 1 rank in Knowledge (religion), about to take the 2nd, 4th or 5th ranger level. Class skills: the ranger's plus Diplomacy. (Champions of Valor has these abilities but no ranger substitution class.)
Natural Attack Style	KEY:Fangshields Ranger ~ Natural Attack Style	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.481	DESC:Often lacking hands, Fangshields rangers have a third combat style option: natural attacks (Ranger Combat Style category) - Multiattack at 2nd level (or Improved Natural Attack with only one kind of natural attack), Weapon Focus with one natural attack at 6th, and at 11th Weapon Focus with a second natural weapon or Greater Weapon Focus with the only one, without prerequisites (Weapon Focus by hand).
Bonded Animal Companion	KEY:Fangshields Ranger ~ Bonded Animal Companion	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	BONUS:VAR|AnimalCompanionLVL|2	SOURCEPAGE:p.481	DESC:Being beastlike himself, his effective druid level for the animal companion is half his ranger level + 2 (applied).
Lion and the Unicorn	KEY:Fangshields Ranger ~ Lion and the Unicorn	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Favored Enemy|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.481	DESC:He chooses an affinity for Nobanion (+1 sacred bonus to AC during the day) or Lurue (+1 sacred bonus to AC at night), on the Material Plane only, regardless of his patron deity. Replaces the second favored enemy gained at 5th level (applied).

###Block: Gnome Ranger substitution levels
Gnome Ranger	KEY:Gnome Ranger ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.483	DESC:Gnome rangers embracing their connection to burrowing animals and stealthy tactics. Requirements: a gnome about to take the 1st, 4th or 8th ranger level.
Gnome Favored Enemy	KEY:Gnome Ranger ~ Gnome Favored Enemy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	ABILITY:Ranger Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Ranger ~ Favored Enemy	SOURCEPAGE:p.483	DESC:As the ranger's favored enemy, but against humanoid (goblinoid), humanoid (reptilian) or giant the bonuses are +3, and later bonus increases against them +3 instead of +2 (by hand). Replaces the 1st-level favored enemy.
Burrowing Animal Companion	KEY:Gnome Ranger ~ Burrowing Animal Companion	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.483	DESC:If she chooses a badger, dire badger, wolverine or other mammalian animal with a burrow speed as her companion, her effective druid level is half her ranger level + 3 (dire badger and wolverine still -3 as alternative companions) - by hand, as it depends on the companion; she can speak with it at will through her racial speak with animals. Replaces share spells.
Gnome Ranger Spells	KEY:Gnome Ranger ~ Gnome Ranger Spells	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SPELLLEVEL:CLASS|Ranger=2|Blur,Invisibility,Misdirection	SPELLLEVEL:CLASS|Ranger=4|Invisibility (Greater),Phantasmal Killer	SOURCEPAGE:p.483	DESC:Blur, invisibility and misdirection are added to her 2nd-level ranger spells, greater invisibility and phantasmal killer to her 4th-level ranger spells (applied); they replace barkskin, snare and wind wall, and commune with nature and tree stride (remove by hand).

###Block: Half-Elf Ranger substitution levels
Half-Elf Ranger	KEY:Half-Elf Ranger ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.484	DESC:Half-elf rangers mixing rural and urban life - investigators and bounty hunters. Requirements: a half-elf about to take the 1st, 4th or 13th ranger level. Class skills: the ranger's plus Gather Information and Speak Language.
Urban Tracking	KEY:Half-Elf Ranger ~ Urban Tracking	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.484	DESC:She gains Urban Tracking as a bonus feat instead of Track (granted when a book defining the feat is loaded - Unearthed Arcana, Cityscape, Races of Destiny, Dungeonscape or Eberron; otherwise by hand); from 8th level she can cut the time per Gather Information check to 30 minutes without the -5 penalty. Replaces the bonus Track feat.
Street Magic	KEY:Half-Elf Ranger ~ Street Magic	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SPELLLEVEL:CLASS|Ranger=1|Comprehend Languages,Detect Secret Doors,Message	SPELLLEVEL:CLASS|Ranger=2|Detect Thoughts,Tongues	SPELLLEVEL:CLASS|Ranger=3|Phantom Steed	SPELLLEVEL:CLASS|Ranger=4|Dimension Door	SOURCEPAGE:p.484	DESC:Added to her ranger spell list (applied): 1st comprehend languages, detect secret doors, message; 2nd detect thoughts, tongues; 3rd phantom steed; 4th dimension door. She loses detect animals or plants, detect snares and pits, entangle, summon nature's ally I-IV, snare, speak with plants, command plants, diminish plants, plant growth, tree shape, commune with nature and tree stride (remove by hand).
Skill Mastery	KEY:Half-Elf Ranger ~ Skill Mastery	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.484	DESC:She selects 3 + her Intelligence modifier skills; with them she may take 10 even when stress and distraction would prevent it. Replaces camouflage.

###Block: Moon-Warded Ranger substitution levels
Moon-Warded Ranger	KEY:Moon-Warded Ranger ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.486	DESC:Rangers who worship the moon. Requirements: worship of the moon (not checked), about to take the 2nd, 6th or 11th ranger level.
Armor of the Senses	KEY:Moon-Warded Ranger ~ Armor of the Senses	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	BONUS:COMBAT|AC|max(0,WIS)|TYPE=Wisdom|!PREEQUIP:1,TYPE=Armor.Medium,TYPE=Armor.Heavy	SOURCEPAGE:p.486	DESC:She adds her Wisdom bonus to AC in light or no armor, even against touch attacks and when flat-footed (applied while not in medium or heavy armor); she loses it when immobilized or helpless or with a medium or heavy load. Replaces combat style.
Skin of the Moon	KEY:Moon-Warded Ranger ~ Skin of the Moon	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.486	DESC:Damage reduction 2/- at night, whether or not the moon is visible, 3/- under the unobscured light of the moon; it stacks with damage reduction of the same type. Replaces improved combat style.
Indomitable Mind	KEY:Moon-Warded Ranger ~ Indomitable Mind	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Immunity to Mind-Affecting	SOURCEPAGE:p.486	DESC:Immunity to mind-affecting spells and abilities, except harmless ones such as bless and heroism (applied as the standard immunity). Replaces combat style mastery.

###Block: Planar Ranger substitution levels
Planar Ranger	KEY:Planar Ranger ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.489	DESC:Rangers who track their quarry across the planes. Requirements: about to take the 4th, 8th or 13th ranger level, and any one of: 1 rank in Knowledge (the planes), a heritage feat, the extraplanar subtype on the Material Plane, or a visit to another plane.
Planar Animal Companion	KEY:Planar Ranger ~ Planar Animal Companion	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	BONUS:VAR|AnimalCompanionLVL|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.489	DESC:He can select a celestial (nonevil ranger) or fiendish (nongood ranger) animal as his companion, a magical beast he can still affect with his spells as an animal; his effective druid level is reduced by one (applied). If his alignment becomes ineligible, it turns on him or leaves.
Portal Intuition	KEY:Planar Ranger ~ Portal Intuition	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.489	DESC:Examining a portal, DC 20 Survival and DC 20 Knowledge (the planes) checks tell him where it leads; a DC 20 Search check tells whether a planar breach occurred within 20 feet in the last 24 hours, and then where it led. Replaces swift tracker.
Planar Tracking	KEY:Planar Ranger ~ Planar Tracking	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SPELLS:Innate|TIMES=1|CASTERLEVEL=RangerLVL|Plane Shift	SOURCEPAGE:p.489	DESC:Once per day, while tracking a favored enemy at the spot where it changed planes, he can use plane shift (caster level = class level) with no deviation: he and his companions arrive exactly where the quarry did. Replaces camouflage.

###Block: Shifter Ranger substitution levels
Shifter Ranger	KEY:Shifter Ranger ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.491	DESC:Shifter rangers drawing on their lycanthrope heritage. Requirements: a shifter about to take the 1st, 4th or 9th ranger level. Class skills: the ranger's plus Balance.
Wild Empathy (Wisdom)	KEY:Shifter Ranger ~ Wild Empathy (Wisdom)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.491	DESC:As the druid's wild empathy, but he adds his Wisdom modifier instead of his Charisma modifier to the check.
Share Shifting	KEY:Shifter Ranger ~ Share Shifting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.491	DESC:The benefits of his shifting extend to his animal companion if adjacent when he begins shifting (not new natural weapons; for a natural weapon it already has, +1 damage per four ranger levels); they end with his shifting. Replaces share spells.
Enhanced Shifting	KEY:Shifter Ranger ~ Enhanced Shifting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Ranger Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.491	DESC:An extra benefit while shifting, by his primary shifter trait: Strength traits (gorebrute, longtooth, razorclaw) - natural weapons count as adamantine against damage reduction; Dexterity traits - improved evasion; other traits as in the compendium (by hand).

###Block: Duskling Barbarian substitution levels
Duskling Barbarian	KEY:Duskling Barbarian ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.98	DESC:Duskling barbarians channel incarnum into speed and defense. Requirements: a duskling about to take the 1st, 7th or 11th barbarian level. Class skills: the barbarian's plus Knowledge (the planes).
Incarnum Speed	KEY:Duskling Barbarian ~ Incarnum Speed	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.98	DESC:Each point of essentia invested increases her base land speed by 10 feet (enhancement; only in medium, light or no armor and without a heavy load; not stacking with the duskling racial speed increase) and grants an insight bonus on initiative equal to twice the invested essentia. Replaces fast movement.
Incarnum Defense	KEY:Duskling Barbarian ~ Incarnum Defense	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.98	DESC:Each point of essentia invested grants damage reduction 1/- and resistance 1 to acid, cold, electricity, fire and sonic. Replaces damage reduction - she never gains damage reduction from barbarian levels.
Incarnum Rage	KEY:Duskling Barbarian ~ Incarnum Rage	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.98	DESC:When she enters a rage she gains 2 points of essentia, disappearing when the rage ends. Replaces greater rage; if she would later gain mighty rage she gains greater rage instead (by hand).

###Block: Goliath Barbarian substitution levels
Goliath Barbarian	KEY:Goliath Barbarian ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.101	DESC:Goliath barbarians tapping the mountains' strength. Requirements: a goliath about to take the 1st, 5th or 7th barbarian level. Class skills: the barbarian's plus Knowledge (nature).
Mountain Rage	KEY:Goliath Barbarian ~ Mountain Rage	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.101	DESC:When he rages his size becomes Large (space and reach 10 feet, -1 on attack rolls and AC, no further weapon size or grapple benefits beyond powerful build; equipment still fits) and he gains a further +2 Strength, on top of the normal rage (+4 Strength and Constitution, +2 Will, -2 AC, fatigue afterwards); extra uses and improvements of rage apply to it. Replaces rage (the rage itself is kept).
Fortification	KEY:Goliath Barbarian ~ Fortification	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.101	DESC:A 25%% chance that a critical hit or sneak attack against him is negated and damage rolled normally. Replaces improved uncanny dodge.
Skin of Stone	KEY:Goliath Barbarian ~ Skin of Stone	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	DEFINE:GoliathBarbarianDR|0	BONUS:VAR|GoliathBarbarianDR|2+2*floor((BarbarianLVL-7)/3)	DR:GoliathBarbarianDR/Adamantine	SOURCEPAGE:p.101	DESC:Damage reduction %1/adamantine (2 at 7th level, +2 at 10th, 13th, 16th and 19th; applied). Replaces the barbarian's damage reduction.|2+2*floor((BarbarianLVL-7)/3)

###Block: Half-Orc Barbarian substitution levels
Half-Orc Barbarian	KEY:Half-Orc Barbarian ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.101	DESC:Half-orc berserkers fond of huge, cleaving weapons. Requirements: a half-orc about to take the 2nd, 5th or 7th barbarian level.
Reckless Charge	KEY:Half-Orc Barbarian ~ Reckless Charge	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.101	DESC:When charging he gains +4 on the attack roll and takes -4 to AC (instead of the normal +2/-2). Replaces uncanny dodge; if he would later gain improved uncanny dodge as a barbarian he gains uncanny dodge instead.
Insightful Rage	KEY:Half-Orc Barbarian ~ Insightful Rage	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.101	DESC:While raging, +4 on Will saves to disbelieve illusion spells. Replaces improved uncanny dodge.
Two-Handed Strike	KEY:Half-Orc Barbarian ~ Two-Handed Strike	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	BONUS:VAR|BarbarianDRLVL|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.101	DESC:+2 on damage rolls with any two-handed melee weapon. Replaces the damage reduction 1/- gained at 7th level: from then on his damage reduction is one point lower (1/- at 10th, 2/- at 13th ...; applied).

###Block: Halfling Barbarian substitution levels
Halfling Barbarian	KEY:Halfling Barbarian ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.102	DESC:Tribal halflings as dangerous as any barbarian, slipping past defenses. Requirements: a halfling about to take the 1st, 3rd or 5th barbarian level.
Halfling Rage	KEY:Halfling Barbarian ~ Halfling Rage	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.102	DESC:While raging he is treated as Medium whenever beneficial (such as in a grapple) and loses his +1 size bonus to AC and on attacks; otherwise exactly like rage (extra uses and rage feats apply to it). Replaces rage (the rage itself is kept).
Intimidating Presence	KEY:Halfling Barbarian ~ Intimidating Presence	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	BONUS:SKILL|Intimidate|floor(BarbarianLVL/3)	SOURCEPAGE:p.102	DESC:Ritual scarring and tribal tattoos: +%1 on Intimidate checks (+1 at 3rd, +1 more whenever he would improve trap sense; applied). Replaces trap sense (trap sense from another class works normally).|floor(BarbarianLVL/3)
Bigger Than Life	KEY:Halfling Barbarian ~ Bigger Than Life	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.102	DESC:He makes Intimidate checks as if he were Medium (no further effect if he actually is Medium, keeping the intimidating presence bonus). Replaces improved uncanny dodge.

###Block: Planar Barbarian substitution levels
Planar Barbarian	KEY:Planar Barbarian ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.105	DESC:Barbarians who travel the planes, refining their abilities against extraplanar enemies. Requirements: about to take the 3rd, 7th or 11th barbarian level, and any one of: 1 rank in Knowledge (the planes), a heritage feat, the extraplanar subtype on the Material Plane, or a visit to another plane.
Portal Sense	KEY:Planar Barbarian ~ Portal Sense	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	BONUS:VAR|TrapSenseBonus|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.105	DESC:He becomes aware of any portal within 30 feet, even invisible ones; spending standard actions "sniffing" it he learns whether it is one- or two-way (round 1), special conditions of its use (round 2) and a 10-second sense of its destination (round 3). Replaces the trap sense gained at 3rd level: from then on his trap sense is one lower (+1 at 6th, +2 at 9th ...; applied).
Planar Damage Reduction	KEY:Planar Barbarian ~ Planar Damage Reduction	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	BONUS:VAR|BarbarianDRLVL|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.105	DESC:He subtracts 2 points from damage dealt by weapons or natural attacks of outsiders and extraplanar creatures (damage reduction 2/- against them, stacking with his normal DR). Replaces the damage reduction 1/- gained at 7th level: from then on his normal damage reduction is one lower (1/- at 10th ...; applied).
Menacing Rage	KEY:Planar Barbarian ~ Menacing Rage	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Barbarian Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.105	DESC:While raging, an aura weakens hostile outsiders and extraplanar creatures within 20 feet: Will DC %1 (10 + half his barbarian level + Constitution modifier) or -2 on attack rolls, checks and saves against him for 24 hours (mind-affecting; a successful save protects for 24 hours). Replaces greater rage; if he later qualifies for mighty rage he gains greater rage instead (by hand).|10+floor(BarbarianLVL/2)+CON

###Block: Changeling Rogue substitution levels
Changeling Rogue	KEY:Changeling Rogue ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.504	DESC:Changeling rogues using their varied personas. Requirements: a changeling about to take the 1st, 3rd or 8th rogue level. Class skills: the rogue's plus one Knowledge skill (all Knowledge skills are offered here).
Social Intuition	KEY:Changeling Rogue ~ Social Intuition	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.504	DESC:Gather Information takes 1d4+1 x 10 minutes (not hours), a Sense Motive hunch is a full-round action, and he can take 10 on Bluff, Diplomacy, Gather Information, Intimidate and Sense Motive even under stress. Replaces trapfinding (he can still find traps of DC 20 or lower and disarm mundane traps).
Minor Lore	KEY:Changeling Rogue ~ Minor Lore	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	BONUS:SKILL|TYPE=Knowledge|floor(RogueLVL/3)	SOURCEPAGE:p.504	DESC:+%1 on all Knowledge checks (+1 at 3rd level, +1 every three levels; applied; it does not make untrained checks trained); an ally he aids on a Knowledge check adds this bonus too. Replaces trap sense, never gained later.|floor(RogueLVL/3)
Mutable Anatomy	KEY:Changeling Rogue ~ Mutable Anatomy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.504	DESC:A 50%% chance that a critical hit or sneak attack against him is negated and damage rolled normally (separate from other fortification). Replaces improved uncanny dodge.

###Block: Dwarf Rogue substitution levels
Dwarf Rogue	KEY:Dwarf Rogue ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.507	DESC:Dwarf rogues expert at demolition. Requirements: a dwarf about to take the 1st, 3rd or 5th rogue level. Class skills: the rogue's plus Knowledge (architecture and engineering).
Demolitionist	KEY:Dwarf Rogue ~ Demolitionist	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	BONUS:VAR|SneakAttackDice|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.507	DESC:+1d6 damage against constructs and objects (not ignoring hardness or damage reduction). Replaces the +1d6 sneak attack gained at 1st level (one die fewer from then on; applied).
Expert Demolitionist	KEY:Dwarf Rogue ~ Expert Demolitionist	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	BONUS:VAR|SneakAttackDice|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.507	DESC:+2d6 damage against constructs and objects, and +2 competence on Craft, Disable Device or Knowledge (architecture and engineering) checks to demolish, tunnel through or degrade structures (or plan to). Replaces the sneak attack increase at 3rd level (applied).
Rapid Demolitionist	KEY:Dwarf Rogue ~ Rapid Demolitionist	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	BONUS:VAR|SneakAttackDice|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.507	DESC:+3d6 damage against constructs and objects; demolition tasks taking more than 1 minute take half as long (a 1-minute task 5 rounds, a full-round task a standard action). Replaces the sneak attack increase at 5th level (applied).

###Block: Golden Hand of Vergadain substitution levels
Golden Hand of Vergadain	KEY:Golden Hand of Vergadain ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.509	DESC:Dwarves of the Golden Hands of Vergadain defending dwarven commerce. Requirements: a dwarf, member of the Golden Hands (not checked), 1 rank in Knowledge (religion), about to take the 2nd, 3rd or 6th rogue level.
Favored Enemy (Organization)	KEY:Golden Hand of Vergadain ~ Favored Enemy (Organization)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	BONUS:SAVE|Reflex|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.509	DESC:An organization in Faerun opposing dwarves as a favored enemy: +2 on weapon damage rolls and on Bluff, Listen, Sense Motive, Spot and Survival checks against its recognized members (it cannot detect members). Replaces the +1 Reflex save gained at 2nd level - his Reflex save is 1 lower than a standard rogue's (applied).
Track	KEY:Golden Hand of Vergadain ~ Track	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	ABILITY:FEAT|AUTOMATIC|Track	SOURCEPAGE:p.509	DESC:Track as a bonus feat (applied); whenever he would gain a trap sense increase he gains +1 on checks to track instead. Replaces trap sense.
Urban Tracking (Gather Information)	KEY:Golden Hand of Vergadain ~ Urban Tracking (Gather Information)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	BONUS:COMBAT|BASEAB|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.509	DESC:He can use Gather Information to track targets in an urban setting (same DCs and results). Replaces the +1 base attack bonus gained at 6th level - his base attack bonus is 1 lower than a standard rogue's (applied).

###Block: Goliath Rogue substitution levels
Goliath Rogue	KEY:Goliath Rogue ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.510	DESC:Goliath tribal scouts embracing toughness over agility. Requirements: a goliath about to take the 2nd, 3rd or 8th rogue level. Hit Die d8 for these levels. Class skills: the rogue's plus Survival.
Mettle of Mountains	KEY:Goliath Rogue ~ Mettle of Mountains	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	BONUS:SAVE|Fortitude|4	SOURCEPAGE:p.510	DESC:+4 on Fortitude saves (applied); on a successful Fortitude save against a spell that would reduce its effect she suffers no effect ("Fortitude partial/half" spells); if she later gains improved evasion as a special ability, a failed save gives the effect of a successful one. Replaces evasion.
Wild Sense	KEY:Goliath Rogue ~ Wild Sense	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.510	DESC:+%1 on Knowledge (nature) and Survival checks in aboveground natural environments (+1 at 3rd level, +1 every three levels to +6 at 18th). Replaces trap sense and its improvements.|floor(RogueLVL/3)
Fortification	KEY:Goliath Rogue ~ Fortification	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.510	DESC:A 25%% chance that a critical hit or sneak attack against her is negated and damage rolled normally. Replaces improved uncanny dodge.

###Block: Halfling Rogue substitution levels
Halfling Rogue	KEY:Halfling Rogue ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.511	DESC:Halfling rogues favoring thrown weapons and luck. Requirements: a halfling about to take the 1st, 3rd or 10th rogue level.
Ranged Sneak Attack	KEY:Halfling Rogue ~ Ranged Sneak Attack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.511	DESC:With a thrown weapon or sling her sneak attack deals +1d6 extra; in melee her sneak attack is reduced by 1d6 (none at 1st level). Augments sneak attack.
Thief's Luck	KEY:Halfling Rogue ~ Thief's Luck	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.511	DESC:She can reroll a Reflex save she has just rolled (before the result is known) and abide by the second roll, %1/day (once at 3rd level, +1 every three levels), not more than once per round. Replaces trap sense, never gained from rogue levels.|1+floor((RogueLVL-3)/3)
Sniping Mastery	KEY:Halfling Rogue ~ Sniping Mastery	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Rogue Special Ability|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.511	DESC:Hidden at least 10 feet from her target, she can make ranged attacks and immediately hide again as a free action at only -10 on the Hide check. Replaces the special ability gained at 10th level (one fewer selection; applied).

###Block: Lunar Rogue substitution levels
Lunar Rogue	KEY:Lunar Rogue ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.513	DESC:Rogues calling on the moon's essence. Requirements: worship of the moon (not checked), about to take the 4th, 8th or 10th rogue level.
Raging Rogue	KEY:Lunar Rogue ~ Raging Rogue	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.513	DESC:She can rage as a barbarian once per day (no greater, tireless or mighty rage without barbarian levels). Replaces uncanny dodge.
Changing Rogue	KEY:Lunar Rogue ~ Changing Rogue	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.513	DESC:Once per day, greater invisibility or polymorph (chosen once, self only) as a spell-like ability at caster level = rogue level. Replaces improved uncanny dodge.
Empowered Rogue	KEY:Lunar Rogue ~ Empowered Rogue	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Rogue Special Ability|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.513	DESC:Once per day, dominate person (Will DC %1) or true seeing (self only) as a spell-like ability (chosen once; caster level = rogue level). Replaces the special ability gained at 10th level (one fewer selection; applied).|10+floor(RogueLVL/2)+CHA

###Block: Planar Rogue substitution levels
Planar Rogue	KEY:Planar Rogue ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.514	DESC:Rogues of the planes. Requirements: about to take the 6th, 10th or 16th rogue level, and any one of: 1 rank in Knowledge (the planes), a heritage feat, the extraplanar subtype on the Material Plane, or a visit to another plane.
Breach Sense	KEY:Planar Rogue ~ Breach Sense	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	BONUS:VAR|TrapSenseBonus|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.514	DESC:She automatically detects the activation of any portal or planar breach within 30 feet and any effect crossing the planes there (summon monster, teleport, plane shift); a DC 25 Spot check pinpoints it with line of sight. Replaces the trap sense increase at 6th level - her trap sense is 1 lower from then on (applied).
Slip the Bonds	KEY:Planar Rogue ~ Slip the Bonds	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Rogue Special Ability|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.514	DESC:Once per day as a free action she turns ethereal for one round. Replaces the special ability gained at 10th level (applied).
Blink	KEY:Planar Rogue ~ Blink	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	SPELLS:Innate|TIMES=1|CASTERLEVEL=RogueLVL|Blink	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Rogue Special Ability|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.514	DESC:Once per day, blink on herself for half her rogue level in rounds (spell-like; applied). Replaces the special ability gained at 16th level (applied).

###Block: Rilkan Rogue substitution levels
Rilkan Rogue	KEY:Rilkan Rogue ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.515	DESC:Rilkan rogues living on the edge. Requirements: a rilkan about to take the 1st, 3rd or 10th rogue level. Class skills: the rogue's plus Speak Language.
Improved Flanking	KEY:Rilkan Rogue ~ Improved Flanking	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	BONUS:VAR|SneakAttackDice|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.515	DESC:When flanking, +4 on attack rolls instead of +2 (other rilkans flanking the same opponent benefit too). Replaces the sneak attack gained at 1st level: she gains sneak attack at 3rd level, one die lower throughout (applied).
Bardic Knowledge	KEY:Rilkan Rogue ~ Bardic Knowledge	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Bardic Knowledge	DEFINE:BardicKnowledgeLVL|0	BONUS:VAR|BardicKnowledgeLVL|RogueLVL	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Rilkan Rogue Bonus Feat|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.515	DESC:As the bard's bardic knowledge, with her rogue level plus Intelligence modifier (applied); also a bonus feat at 3rd level from Deceitful, Diligent, Investigator, Negotiator or Persuasive (Rilkan Rogue Bonus Feat category). Replaces trap sense, never gained from rogue levels.
Fortunate Reflexes	KEY:Rilkan Rogue ~ Fortunate Reflexes	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Rogue Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Rogue Special Ability|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.515	DESC:She can reroll any failed Reflex save (except a natural 1), taking the reroll. Replaces the special ability gained at 10th level (applied).

###Block: Gnome Bard substitution levels
Gnome Bard	KEY:Gnome Bard ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Bard Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.120	DESC:Gnome bards weaving illusions and countering fear. Requirements: a gnome about to take the 1st, 3rd, 6th or 11th bard level.
Gnome Cantrips	KEY:Gnome Bard ~ Gnome Cantrips	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Bard Class Feature	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Bard=0|Dancing Lights,Ghost Sound,Prestidigitation	SOURCEPAGE:p.120	DESC:Dancing lights, ghost sound and prestidigitation are added to his bard spells known (applied); they replace two of the cantrips a bard knows at 1st level (one fewer cantrip known of his choice - by hand).
Counter Fear	KEY:Gnome Bard ~ Counter Fear	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Bard Class Feature	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ BardCountersong	SOURCEPAGE:p.120	DESC:With 3 or more ranks in Perform, each round he performs he makes a Perform check: any ally within 30 feet (himself included) affected by a fear effect can use it in place of its saving throw if higher; one already under a fear effect gets a new save each round, using his result; up to 10 rounds; no effect against effects without saves. Replaces countersong (applied).
Inspire Defiance	KEY:Gnome Bard ~ Inspire Defiance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Bard Class Feature	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ BardInspireCompetence	SOURCEPAGE:p.120	DESC:With 6 or more ranks in Perform, allies within 30 feet who hear him gain +2 on saves against illusions and mind-affecting spells and effects while they hear him and 5 rounds after. Replaces inspire competence (applied).
Phantasmal Song	KEY:Gnome Bard ~ Phantasmal Song	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Bard Class Feature	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ BardSuggestion	SOURCEPAGE:p.120	DESC:With 9 or more ranks in Perform, enemies within 30 feet who hear the eerie melody become shaken (Will DC %1 negates), frightened after 3 consecutive rounds; it lasts while he performs and 1 round after, or until they move away; multiple phantasmal songs do not stack, but it stacks with other fear effects (illusion (phantasm), mind-affecting fear). Replaces suggestion (applied).|10+floor(BardLVL/2)+CHA
Secrets of Bardic Trickery	KEY:Gnome Bard ~ Secrets of Bardic Trickery	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Bard Class Feature	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Bard=1|Color Spray	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Bard=2|Touch of Idiocy	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Bard=4|Phantasmal Killer	SOURCEPAGE:p.120	DESC:Color spray (1st), touch of idiocy (2nd) and phantasmal killer (4th) are added to his spells known (applied). Replaces the new 4th-level spell and the spell exchange of 11th level: from then on he knows one fewer 4th-level spell than the table shows (by hand).

###Block: Half-Elf Bard substitution levels
Half-Elf Bard	KEY:Half-Elf Bard ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Bard Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.122	DESC:Half-elf bards using reason and diplomacy. Requirements: a half-elf about to take the 1st, 6th or 8th bard level.
Soothing Voice	KEY:Half-Elf Bard ~ Soothing Voice	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Bard Class Feature	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ BardCountersong	SOURCEPAGE:p.122	DESC:With 3 or more ranks in Diplomacy she spends a daily use of bardic music to calm the emotions of creatures within 30 feet who understand her language (like fascinate): her Diplomacy check is the DC of their Will saves; on a failure, calm emotions while they listen. Replaces countersong (applied).
Command	KEY:Half-Elf Bard ~ Command	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Bard Class Feature	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ BardSuggestion	SOURCEPAGE:p.122	DESC:With at least 9 ranks in Diplomacy she spends a daily use of bardic music to command (as the spell) a creature within 30 feet, or all creatures she has soothed or fascinated; Will DC %1 negates. Replaces suggestion (applied).|11+CHA
Secrets of the Diplomat	KEY:Half-Elf Bard ~ Secrets of the Diplomat	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Bard Class Feature	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Bard=1|Command	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Bard=2|Zone of Truth	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Bard=4|Sending	SOURCEPAGE:p.122	DESC:Command (1st), zone of truth (2nd) and sending (4th) are added to her spells known (applied). Replaces the 4th-level spell learned at 8th level: from then on she knows one fewer 4th-level spell than normal (by hand).

###Block: Planar Bard substitution levels
Planar Bard	KEY:Planar Bard ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Bard Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.125	DESC:Bards who travel the planes; each benefit replaces a standard bardic music ability and costs a use of bardic music. Requirements: about to take the 3rd, 6th or 12th bard level, and any one of: 1 rank in Knowledge (the planes), a heritage feat, the extraplanar subtype on the Material Plane, or a visit to another plane.
Planar Inspiration	KEY:Planar Bard ~ Planar Inspiration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Bard Class Feature	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ BardInspireCompetence	SOURCEPAGE:p.125	DESC:With 6 or more ranks in Perform: a full minute of performance and a Perform check (DC 15 for mild, 25 for strong alignment traits; no taking 10) spare him and allies within 30 feet who heard it the penalties of planar alignment traits for 24 hours (mind-affecting). Replaces inspire competence (applied).
Portal Dissonance	KEY:Planar Bard ~ Portal Dissonance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Bard Class Feature	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ BardSuggestion	SOURCEPAGE:p.125	DESC:With 9 or more ranks in Perform he influences portals and moderate or severe planar breaches - closing them, or redirecting travelers to another portal he has passed through in the last 30 days - for up to 10 rounds (one bardic music use). Replaces suggestion (applied); if he later qualifies for mass suggestion he gains suggestion instead (by hand).
Planar Discordance	KEY:Planar Bard ~ Planar Discordance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Bard Class Feature	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ BardSongOfFreedom	SOURCEPAGE:p.125	DESC:With 15 or more ranks in Perform, a full minute of performance creates a minor planar breach (as precipitate breach), onset 1d4 rounds; further bardic music uses can exacerbate it. Replaces song of freedom (applied).

###Block: Dark Moon Disciple substitution levels
Dark Moon Disciple	KEY:Dark Moon Disciple ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.358	DESC:Monks of the Dark Moon, Shar's sect. Requirements: Shar as patron deity, membership (not checked), 1 rank in Knowledge (religion), about to take the 3rd, 7th or 12th monk level.
Darkvision	KEY:Dark Moon Disciple ~ Darkvision	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ MonkStillMind	BONUS:VAR|DarkvisionRange|60|TYPE=Base	SOURCEPAGE:p.358	DESC:Darkvision 60 feet (applied). Replaces still mind (applied).
Shadow Blend	KEY:Dark Moon Disciple ~ Shadow Blend	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ MonkWholenessOfBody	SOURCEPAGE:p.358	DESC:In any conditions other than full daylight she can disappear into the shadows, gaining total concealment (artificial light does not negate it; daylight does). Replaces wholeness of body (applied).
Walk the Shadows	KEY:Dark Moon Disciple ~ Walk the Shadows	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ MonkAbundantStep	SPELLS:Innate|TIMES=1|CASTERLEVEL=MonkLVL|Dimension Door	SOURCEPAGE:p.358	DESC:Once per day she jumps from shadow to shadow as dimension door (caster level = monk level), leaving and arriving only in shadowy illumination (applied as dimension door 1/day). Replaces abundant step (applied).

###Block: Halfling Monk substitution levels
Halfling Monk	KEY:Halfling Monk ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.367	DESC:Halfling monks focused on mobility. Requirements: a halfling about to take the 1st, 2nd or 7th monk level.
Skirmish	KEY:Halfling Monk ~ Skirmish	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ MonkFlurryOfBlows	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ MonkGreaterFlurry	SOURCEPAGE:p.367	DESC:+%1d6 damage with unarmed strikes or special monk weapons in any round she moves at least 10 feet (+1d6, +2d6 from 11th level; ranged only within 30 feet; living creatures with discernible anatomy), and from 5th level +1 competence to AC in such a round (+2 from 15th); not in armor or with a medium or heavy load. Replaces flurry of blows and greater flurry (applied); she may multiclass freely between monk and rogue.|1+(MonkLVL>=11)
Weapon Finesse	KEY:Halfling Monk ~ Weapon Finesse	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Monk Feat LVL 2|-1	ABILITY:FEAT|AUTOMATIC|Weapon Finesse	SOURCEPAGE:p.367	DESC:Weapon Finesse as a bonus feat (applied). Replaces the 2nd-level bonus feat (applied).
Size Matters Not	KEY:Halfling Monk ~ Size Matters Not	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ MonkWholenessOfBody	SOURCEPAGE:p.367	DESC:With Improved Grapple, +4 on grapple checks against foes at least two sizes larger; with Stunning Fist, +4 on its DC against them. Replaces wholeness of body (applied).

###Block: Hin Disciple substitution levels
Hin Disciple	KEY:Hin Disciple ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.368	DESC:Halfling monks of the Hin Fist, bringing down larger foes. Requirements: a halfling member of the Hin Fist (not checked), 1 rank in Knowledge (religion), about to take the 1st, 6th or 9th monk level.
Hin Bonus Feats	KEY:Hin Disciple ~ Hin Bonus Feats	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.368	DESC:At 1st level he may choose Underfoot Combat (from Races of the Wild - by hand: move through the space of Large or larger foes without attacks of opportunity, +4 cover there) or Stunning Fist instead of Improved Grapple, and at 2nd level Improved Trip or Combat Reflexes, without prerequisites; he gains no bonus feat at 6th level.
Blur of Motion	KEY:Hin Disciple ~ Blur of Motion	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Monk Feat LVL 6|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.368	DESC:With at least 5 ranks in Tumble, against Large or larger foes he can use total defense and still make a single attack (full-round action). Replaces the 6th-level bonus feat (applied).
The Harder They Fall	KEY:Hin Disciple ~ The Harder They Fall	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ MonkImprovedEvasion	SOURCEPAGE:p.368	DESC:With Improved Trip, when he trips a foe whose square he occupies, every ally within reach of it may make one attack at full bonus (+4 against the prone foe) on his turn. Replaces improved evasion, never gained later (applied).

###Block: Illuminated Monk substitution levels
Illuminated Monk	KEY:Illuminated Monk ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.369	DESC:Monks who find focus in meditation and the sun. Requirements: from a sun-centered society or worshipping a sun deity (not checked), about to take the 1st, 2nd or 6th monk level.
Illuminated Bonus Feat (1st)	KEY:Illuminated Monk ~ Illuminated Bonus Feat (1st)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Monk Feat LVL 1|-1	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Illuminated Monk Bonus Feat (1st)|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.369	DESC:Skill Focus as his 1st-level bonus feat (Illuminated Monk Bonus Feat category; applied), instead of the standard monk bonus feat (applied).
Illuminated Bonus Feat (2nd)	KEY:Illuminated Monk ~ Illuminated Bonus Feat (2nd)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Monk Feat LVL 2|-1	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Illuminated Monk Bonus Feat (2nd)|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.369	DESC:Investigator or Negotiator as his 2nd-level bonus feat (category; applied), instead of the standard monk bonus feat (applied).
Meditative Focus	KEY:Illuminated Monk ~ Meditative Focus	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Monk Feat LVL 6|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.369	DESC:Each dawn, 15 minutes of uninterrupted meditation on a skill grant skill mastery (as the rogue) with it until the next dawn. Replaces the 6th-level bonus feat (applied).

###Block: Kalashtar Monk substitution levels
Kalashtar Monk	KEY:Kalashtar Monk ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.370	DESC:Kalashtar monks augmenting their prowess psionically. Requirements: a kalashtar about to take the 1st, 2nd or 7th monk level.
Psychic Insight	KEY:Kalashtar Monk ~ Psychic Insight	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ MonkFlurryOfBlows	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ MonkGreaterFlurry	SOURCEPAGE:p.370	DESC:Once per round as a swift action he spends up to %1 power points (1, 2 at 5th, 3 at 11th) for an equal insight bonus on his next grapple check or stunning fist attack roll within 1 round. Replaces flurry of blows and its improvements (applied).|1+(MonkLVL>=5)+(MonkLVL>=11)
Psionic Bonus Feat	KEY:Kalashtar Monk ~ Psionic Bonus Feat	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Monk Feat LVL 2|-1	SOURCEPAGE:p.370	DESC:Any psionic feat he qualifies for as his 2nd-level bonus feat (Expanded Psionics Handbook - by hand). Replaces the 2nd-level bonus feat (applied).
Psionic Wholeness of Body	KEY:Kalashtar Monk ~ Psionic Wholeness of Body	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.370	DESC:He can spend power points when activating wholeness of body: each point heals 2 extra hit points.

###Block: Planar Monk substitution levels
Planar Monk	KEY:Planar Monk ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.373	DESC:Monks of the planes. Requirements: about to take the 5th, 13th or 16th monk level, and any one of: 1 rank in Knowledge (the planes), a heritage feat, the extraplanar subtype on the Material Plane, or a visit to another plane.
Resistant Body	KEY:Planar Monk ~ Resistant Body	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ MonkPurityOfBody	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Planar Monk Resistant Body|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.373	DESC:Resistance 5 to one type of energy - acid, cold, electricity, fire or sonic - chosen in the category (applied). Replaces purity of body (applied).
Axiomatic Soul	KEY:Planar Monk ~ Axiomatic Soul	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ MonkDiamondSoul	SOURCEPAGE:p.373	DESC:Spell resistance %1 (monk level + 15) against effects generated by chaotic outsiders only. Replaces diamond soul (applied).|MonkLVL+15
Ki Strike (Cold Iron)	KEY:Planar Monk ~ Ki Strike (Cold Iron)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.373	DESC:Her unarmed attacks count as cold iron for overcoming damage reduction. Replaces ki strike (adamantine) - by hand (the PHB monk's ki strike is one ability).

###Block: Skarn Monk substitution levels
Skarn Monk	KEY:Skarn Monk ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.376	DESC:Skarn monks perfecting form and channeling incarnum. Requirements: a skarn about to take the 1st, 5th or 10th monk level. Class skills: the monk's plus Intimidate.
Spine Strike	KEY:Skarn Monk ~ Spine Strike	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.376	DESC:For all monk class features his arm-spine attack counts as an unarmed strike (flurry, ki strike, monk damage progression - by hand). Replaces unarmed strike.
Defensive Insight	KEY:Skarn Monk ~ Defensive Insight	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	ABILITY:ACF|AUTOMATIC|DMC Substitution Marker ~ MonkACBonus	BONUS:COMBAT|AC|max(WIS,0)|PREVAREQ:ENCUMBERANCE,0,var("COUNT[EQTYPE.ARMOR.EQUIPPED]"),0	SOURCEPAGE:p.376	DESC:+1 insight bonus to AC per point of essentia invested (1 essentia at 5th level), applying at all times, even in armor or flat-footed (by hand). He keeps his Wisdom bonus to AC (applied). Replaces the level-based AC bonus (applied).
Shape Soulmeld	KEY:Skarn Monk ~ Shape Soulmeld	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Monk Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.376	DESC:With Constitution 11 or higher he shapes one soulmeld from the soulborn list daily (meldshaper level half his monk level; DC 10 + invested essentia + Wisdom modifier) and can bind it to his arms chakra (Chakra Bind (Arms)). Replaces ki strike (lawful) - by hand.

###Block: Goliath Druid substitution levels
Goliath Druid	KEY:Goliath Druid ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.226	DESC:Goliath druids venerate earth and stone, granting them and their companions powers of elemental earth. Requirements: a goliath about to take the 1st, 6th or 12th druid level.
Elemental Bond	KEY:Goliath Druid ~ Elemental Bond	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.226	DESC:When casting a summon nature's ally spell to summon a creature with the earth subtype, she may treat the spell as the next higher-level version (a single more powerful creature or more of the same type; summon nature's ally IX summons two elder earth elementals). She permanently gives up summoning creatures with the air, fire or water subtype.
Earth Companion	KEY:Goliath Druid ~ Earth Companion	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	BONUS:VAR|AnimalCompanionLVL|-3	SOURCEPAGE:p.226	DESC:She imbues her animal companion with elemental earth: Str +2, Dex -2, natural armor +3, burrow speed 10 ft. (or +10 ft.), earth mastery (+1 on attack and damage if both it and its foe touch the ground; -4 against airborne or waterborne foes), DR 5/magic, earth subtype (apply to the companion by hand). Her effective druid level for the companion is reduced by three (applied).
Wild Shape (Earth)	KEY:Goliath Druid ~ Wild Shape (Earth)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.226	DESC:She can wild shape into an earth elemental with the same size limits as her animal forms; her maximum HD in earth elemental form (also with the elemental wild shape gained at 16th level) is her druid level + 1. Replaces the 12th-level wild shape (plant) ability.

###Block: Half-Orc Druid substitution levels
Half-Orc Druid	KEY:Half-Orc Druid ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.227	DESC:Half-orc druids drawn to the primal brutality of nature, known for brute strength and force of will. Requirements: a half-orc about to take the 1st, 4th or 6th druid level. Class skills: the druid's plus Intimidate.
Tough Animal Companion	KEY:Half-Orc Druid ~ Tough Animal Companion	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.227	DESC:Her animal companion gains Toughness as a bonus feat (add it to the companion by hand).
Bully Animal	KEY:Half-Orc Druid ~ Bully Animal	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.227	DESC:When she uses wild empathy she adds her Strength modifier instead of her Charisma modifier. Replaces resist nature's lure.
Augmented Nature's Allies	KEY:Half-Orc Druid ~ Augmented Nature's Allies	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.227	DESC:Animals she summons with summon nature's ally gain +4 Strength and Constitution (not stacking with Augment Summoning). Replaces the additional daily wild shape gained at 6th level - from then on one fewer daily wild shape (2/day at 7th, 3/day at 10th ...; by hand).

###Block: Halfling Druid substitution levels
Halfling Druid	KEY:Halfling Druid ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.227	DESC:Pragmatic halfling druids who strengthen the bond with their animal companions (often their mounts) and serve as capable scouts. Requirements: a halfling about to take the 1st, 5th or 13th druid level. Class skills: the druid's plus Climb, Hide, Jump and Move Silently; 6 + Int skill points at these levels (by hand).
Spontaneous Casting (Halfling)	KEY:Halfling Druid ~ Spontaneous Casting (Halfling)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.227	DESC:He can lose a prepared spell to cast a spell of the same or lower level from this list, targeting only himself or his animal companion: 1st jump, 2nd spider climb, 3rd protection from energy, 4th freedom of movement, 5th tree stride, 6th-9th summon nature's ally VI-IX. Replaces spontaneous casting.
Enhanced Link	KEY:Halfling Druid ~ Enhanced Link	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.227	DESC:A +4 circumstance bonus on Ride checks with his animal companion and no penalty for riding it without a saddle; while he rides it, it shares his woodland stride and trackless step. Augments the druid's link with his companion.
Undersized Wild Shape	KEY:Halfling Druid ~ Undersized Wild Shape	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.227	DESC:His wild shape (including elemental and other options) is one size category smaller - Tiny or Small animals at 5th level, Medium at 8th, Diminutive at 11th, Large at 15th; Tiny to Medium elementals at 16th, Large at 20th - but he can use it one additional time per day (%1/day now); otherwise as wild shape. Replaces wild shape.|(DruidLVL>=5)+(DruidLVL>=5)+(DruidLVL>=6)+(DruidLVL>=7)+(DruidLVL>=10)+(DruidLVL>=14)+(DruidLVL>=18)
Camouflage	KEY:Halfling Druid ~ Camouflage	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.227	DESC:He can use Hide in any sort of natural terrain, even without cover or concealment. Replaces a thousand faces.

###Block: Planar Druid substitution levels
Planar Druid	KEY:Planar Druid ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.231	DESC:Druids who walk the planes. Requirements: about to take the 4th, 9th or 13th druid level, and any one of: 1 rank in Knowledge (the planes), a heritage feat, the extraplanar subtype on the Material Plane, or a visit to another plane. Class skills: the druid's plus Knowledge (the planes).
Resist Extraplanar Might	KEY:Planar Druid ~ Resist Extraplanar Might	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.231	DESC:A +2 bonus on saving throws against the spell-like abilities of outsiders. Replaces resist nature's lure.
Planar Tolerance	KEY:Planar Druid ~ Planar Tolerance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.231	DESC:She is immune to the natural planar effects of the planes she visits - anything the planar tolerance spell would negate (it affects only her). Replaces venom immunity.
Counter Summoning	KEY:Planar Druid ~ Counter Summoning	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.231	DESC:She can ready a standard action to counter a summon monster spell or a spell-like ability summoning an extraplanar creature, as a counterspell with dispel magic but without casting a spell: a caster level check against DC 11 + the opponent's caster level (or HD). Replaces a thousand faces.

###Block: Shifter Druid substitution levels
Shifter Druid	KEY:Shifter Druid ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.236	DESC:Shifter druids who hold a bestial spirit within their mutable forms. Requirements: a shifter about to take the 1st, 4th or 5th druid level. Class skills: the druid's plus Balance, Climb and Jump.
Beast Spirit	KEY:Shifter Druid ~ Beast Spirit	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	ABILITY:FEAT|AUTOMATIC|Alertness	BONUS:SKILL|Handle Animal|4	SOURCEPAGE:p.236	DESC:An inner beast spirit, extension of his lycanthrope heritage: a +%1 bonus to Strength, Dexterity or Constitution (+0 at 1st-2nd, +2 at 3rd, +4 at 9th, +6 at 15th; chosen when he prepares spells, changed with a minute of concentration - apply by hand); Alertness, extend shifting (+2 rounds), feral empathy (+4 on wild empathy and Handle Animal checks; Handle Animal applied); will of the spirit (3rd: a second save a round after failing one against enchantment); transfer spirit (6th: as a move action, to an animal he summoned within 30 feet, which gains twice the ability bonus); prepare spell (9th: one extra spell of 3rd level or lower, 6th from 15th, touch or personal, cast on himself as a swift action); rapid summons (12th); manifested spirit (18th). Replaces the animal companion (druid levels do not stack with other classes for a companion).|2*((DruidLVL>=3)+(DruidLVL>=9)+(DruidLVL>=15))
Reckless Nature	KEY:Shifter Druid ~ Reckless Nature	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	BONUS:COMBAT|INITIATIVE|2|TYPE=Insight	BONUS:SAVE|Reflex|2|TYPE=Insight	BONUS:SAVE|Will|-2	SOURCEPAGE:p.236	DESC:Relying on his animal instincts: a +2 insight bonus on initiative checks and Reflex saves, and a -2 penalty on Will saves. Replaces resist nature's lure.
Wild Shifting	KEY:Shifter Druid ~ Wild Shifting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Druid Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.236	DESC:He can use his racial shifting ability one additional time per day, with his Wisdom modifier instead of Constitution for its duration; his shifting natural weapons deal damage as one size larger from 8th level, two sizes larger from 15th; whenever a druid gains a daily wild shape use, he gains a daily shifting use instead. No replacement for wild shape (Tiny) or (plant); he gains elemental wild shape as normal from 16th level (by hand). Replaces wild shape.

###Block: hidden markers switching off guarded base class features (substitution levels)
Substitution Marker (BardCountersong)	KEY:DMC Substitution Marker ~ BardCountersong	CATEGORY:ACF	TYPE:ACF.BardCountersong	VISIBLE:NO	COST:0	SOURCEPAGE:p.0	DESC:Hidden marker of a substitution level replacing this feature.
Substitution Marker (BardInspireCompetence)	KEY:DMC Substitution Marker ~ BardInspireCompetence	CATEGORY:ACF	TYPE:ACF.BardInspireCompetence	VISIBLE:NO	COST:0	SOURCEPAGE:p.0	DESC:Hidden marker of a substitution level replacing this feature.
